<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-06T00:28:21.594Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:28:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Talabani, the PUK leader, withdrew from the regional government, dealing a blow to Kurdish influence, while a security guard was killed and three injured in a shooting at an oilfield near Kirkuk. Iranian forces continued attacks on Kurdish opposition, including a missile found on an old drone that was defused in Kirkuk, and a militia leader publicly criticized Iraq's stance on the Iran blockade. Iraqi authorities arrested a Baghdad police chief taking a bribe, reinforced western desert defenses, and declared readiness for a nuclear emergency with limited fallout risk. NATO held a high-level political dialogue with Iraqi officials and Washington broadened its Shia outreach. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQQjYwaVp4WDJJaThZZWllQm9YZmZ3a3FrSFNPSDN2MEtreE9YdlpRV3ZiMm14blBod0Rfc1VWeU5GdGpscTlKRERBbkFyNnZfLUZaX1N3dTBFb1N1Wm1BMXpzMlRQRkZNN0hqVjJmOW1xaWtxN0cydEl5Q19YdUpVOWZ5OXhwU0FFVi1TZzd0MHZtLU5weUhsQjV2MXVoVHpzaU5pdmRnXzdFTU9GSGxFNlNEbGxSMWd0NDllTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al-Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQRHQtZkdmRGt0X2g5dURINVNtQTlRdFhsRUZfTkhFM0VXYmdKeXpxb2YtdHZyajhQdVpfRWV4YXl6TEtTWWlmRXhXVVF1ZHBsTjNiWnBFVEJ5bG9FaWM1TWVJYVVEc3RwNW1obTByOEg1a04xZkJ3ZkYwVkR3Q3VJY2JteW1JUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;IraqiNews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQTFBIeUM2X3VXWEladGFSNkRUQ2Y5d1JuWXA0MnRzV2o0LTBuUkE3VXpBVXZWbkZRYWRieExVTEJBY0xRcHR2MVByQmhnSVQtRW5DUWZzcUI5VzZBa2FBRkJsckUyQUswREZuVDlpYlJyVDY4N2JzWnpqbUtUQXltbFZ4UFkwUl85OWpJZG96NVg0d2t5Q2lVa2NIdVMyZy1GTW02X1lTVVdFbFpGdGhabHdBb2ljZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPaTc3aFNJTHZvanVLaTdZYVlVUDRCOUdpZzdLeGdIcGNJcFl2Sl